{"id":"50091c7f4fac0aab","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-formula-arithmetization.md","title":"布尔公式的有限域算术化","display":"df-formula-arithmetization — 布尔公式的有限域算术化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-formula-arithmetization","aliases":["28-df-formula-arithmetization"],"display":"df-formula-arithmetization — 布尔公式的有限域算术化","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §8.3.1 Arithmetization","source_printed_pages":"158–159","source_pdf_pages":"184–185","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-formula-arithmetization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-formula-arithmetization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-arithmetization — 布尔公式的有限域算术化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §8.3.1 Arithmetization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"158–159"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"184–185"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为任意有限域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_F,1_F\">\\(0_F,1_F\\)</span> 为其不同的加法和乘法单位；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}\\)</span> 的语法和求值见所列本地定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_1,\\ldots,X_n\">\\(X_1,\\ldots,X_n\\)</span> 为形式不定元；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\{0,1\\}\\to F\">\\(\\iota:\\{0,1\\}\\to F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(0)=0_F,\\iota(1)=1_F\">\\(\\iota(0)=0_F,\\iota(1)=1_F\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_F(x_i)\\coloneqq X_i\\quad(1\\le i\\le n),\\qquad A_F(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq1_F-A_F(\\psi),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_F(x_i)\\coloneqq X_i\\quad(1\\le i\\le n),\\qquad A_F(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq1_F-A_F(\\psi),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_F(\\psi\\land\\theta)\\coloneqq A_F(\\psi)A_F(\\theta),\\qquad A_F(\\psi\\lor\\theta)\\coloneqq1_F-(1_F-A_F(\\psi))(1_F-A_F(\\theta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_F(\\psi\\land\\theta)\\coloneqq A_F(\\psi)A_F(\\theta),\\qquad A_F(\\psi\\lor\\theta)\\coloneqq1_F-(1_F-A_F(\\psi))(1_F-A_F(\\theta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_F:\\mathcal B_n\\to F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_F:\\mathcal B_n\\to F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A_F(\\varphi)(\\iota(b_1),\\ldots,\\iota(b_n))=\\iota(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha_b}(\\varphi)),\\qquad\\alpha_b(x_i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b_i&amp;1\\le i\\le n,\\\\0&amp;i=0\\lor i&gt;n.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A_F(\\varphi)(\\iota(b_1),\\ldots,\\iota(b_n))=\\iota(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha_b}(\\varphi)),\\qquad\\alpha_b(x_i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b_i&amp;1\\le i\\le n,\\\\0&amp;i=0\\lor i&gt;n.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>带标签有限语法树上的结构递归存在且唯一。每种连接词在0、1上的多项式真值表正确，结构归纳给出最后等式；特征2时减法等于加法，四个0/1真值仍逐项成立。变量受限子集B_n和赋值在全部变量上的扩张均已在Assertion给出。域中求和仅确定计数模特征的值；恢复整数#SAT另须特征大于2^n，不能从本定义直接省略该条件。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§8.3.1 Arithmetization；印刷 pp.158–159 / PDF pp.184–185。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"0_F,1_F","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"X_1,\\ldots,X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:\\{0,1\\}\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(0)=0_F,\\iota(1)=1_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A_F(x_i)\\coloneqq X_i\\quad(1\\le i\\le n),\\qquad A_F(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq1_F-A_F(\\psi),","display":true},{"tex":"A_F(\\psi\\land\\theta)\\coloneqq A_F(\\psi)A_F(\\theta),\\qquad A_F(\\psi\\lor\\theta)\\coloneqq1_F-(1_F-A_F(\\psi))(1_F-A_F(\\theta)).","display":true},{"tex":"A_F:\\mathcal B_n\\to F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n],","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A_F(\\varphi)(\\iota(b_1),\\ldots,\\iota(b_n))=\\iota(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha_b}(\\varphi)),\\qquad\\alpha_b(x_i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b_i&1\\le i\\le n,\\\\0&i=0\\lor i>n.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":2337,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]、[[28-thm-dip-equals-np]]、[[28-df-formula-arithmetization]]、[[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]]、[[28-thm-sumcheck-soundness]]、[[28-df-program-checker]]。"}],"outgoing":["b830febc662345bf","2eb3efc252f058f9"]}